flowchart LR
    PC[PC Controller / Dashboard] --> BRIDGE[Web Serial / WebSocket Bridge]
    BRIDGE --> MASTER[NODE_00_MASTER / ESP32 Master]

    MASTER --> N1[NODE_01_LED_STATE]
    MASTER --> N2[NODE_02_PROXIMITY_SAFETY]
    MASTER --> N3[NODE_03_MAGNETIC_DOCKING]
    MASTER --> N4[NODE_04_MOTION_ACTUATOR]
    MASTER --> N5[NODE_05_TELEMETRY_SENSOR]
    MASTER --> N6[NODE_06_VISION_CAMERA]

    N1 --> TEL[Telemetry Layer]
    N2 --> TEL
    N3 --> TEL
    N4 --> TEL
    N5 --> TEL
    N6 --> TEL

    TEL --> DASH[Dashboard State Manager]
    DASH --> SIM[Simulation Engine 3D/4D/5D/6D]
    SIM --> VIS[Visual State / Swarm Representation]

    MASTER --> SAFETY[Safety Layer]
    SAFETY --> TEL
    SAFETY --> DASH

    DOCS[Documentation Layer] -.-> PC
    DOCS -.-> MASTER
    DOCS -.-> SIM
